# GDScript Rules

## Style

- Typed functions at domain boundaries: `func apply_damage(amount: int) -> bool`
- `class_name` for reusable services and resources
- Private members prefixed with `_`
- Constants: `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`
- Doc comment `##` at class top — one line describing responsibility

## File order

signals → enums → const → @export → public vars → private vars → @onready → lifecycle → public API → private helpers

## Nodes vs logic

- `extends RefCounted` for pure logic (`HeroProgress`, `DropManager`)
- Domain scripts must not call `get_node()` on UI
- Use signals or injected `Callable` for cross-layer communication

## Async combat patterns

Guard async resolution with flags (`_resolvendo_morte`). Set `party.combate_pausado = true` during death/defeat resolution. Always clear flags after `await`.

## Resources

- Duplicate before mutating dropped items: `modelo.duplicate()`
- Validate JSON/save data with `is Dictionary` / `is Array` before access

## Performance (idle game)

- Prefer `Timer` per hero/enemy over heavy `_process`
- Recalculate stats on events only (equip, tree, level-up)
- Do not allocate per frame in combat hot path

